  "Sensei Hoshi|B \u2014 Behavior (The Idea). Higher timeframe (HTF) is KING (4h/1h). Check it every single hour! Mark respected zones at the highs and lows. Say: 'I want to see price get HERE.' That is your Behavior target.": "8665d0d2f2392e3c.mp3",
