  "|You will practice on two markets. The first is NQ \u2014 Nasdaq-100 futures , which tracks 100 large technology-heavy companies. It moves fast: in the simulator it trades near 21,500 and can move dozens of points in minutes.": "9c4bf2f44619d4fb.mp3",
  "|Your exercise in the practice arena: read the candles, identify the trend, and trade with it \u2014 long in an uptrend, short in a downtrend. First, the quiz.": "d669136e3433700b.mp3",
  "|Your next exercise is the Strategy Scientist trial in the practice arena: five trading days, one strategy, honest results. You pass by following the method , not by being lucky. First, the quiz.": "7efb9128a4aeb904.mp3",
  "|Your stop-loss goes just beyond the zone. If a candle closes past it , the idea is invalid \u2014 exit immediately. No hoping, no moving the stop. Give a trade at most 2\u00bd hours to work; after that, close it and protect your Koins.": "3bf9cf9443bcca11.mp3",
